  "passage": {
    "text": "Marta is a logistics manager in a big company. She plans the work of her team and she controls the costs. Every morning she checks the orders and makes a schedule for the drivers. She is responsible for the budget, and she must not spend too much money. When there is a problem, she makes a quick decision. Last week a driver was ill, so Marta found a new driver in one hour. She also talks to customers and suppliers every day. A good manager is organized and calm.",
